	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<note>[Anfang fehlt?]</note>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/><placeName ref="l311">Marpurgo</placeName> mense septembri <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>scribebat haec d. <persName ref="p8386">Andr. Hyperius</persName><note type="margin">oben a.R. von Bullingers Hand.</note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z3"/>De iis, quę accepi <placeName ref="l569">Wormatia</placeName>, existimavi seorsum paucula <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>adiicienda, non quidem ad me perscripta, sed quorundam, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>quos tamen fide dignos arbitror, exposita sermonibus.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z6"/>Ad quintum diem septembris d. <persName ref="p6469">Erardus Schnepfius</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>d. <persName ref="p3046">Victorinus Strigelius</persName> ex schola Ienensi, d. <persName ref="p5908">Ioachimus <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Morlinus</persName> et cum eo quidam m. <persName>Martinus Luneburgensis</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>item <persName ref="p6369">Erasmus Sarcerius</persName> ex comitatu <placeName ref="l1716">Mansfeldensi</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>(plures non sunt mihi nominati) statim a prandio colloqui <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>cum domino <persName>Philippo</persName> certo loco petiverunt.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Fuerant autem <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>illi scripto complexi suam de cęna domini sententiam <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>atque longa oratione contenderunt a domino <persName>Philippo</persName>, ut ipse <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>cęterique <placeName ref="l558">Vitebergenses</placeName> eam non tam scripto quam <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>iureiurando comprobarent.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Portractum est hinc certa<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>men ad vesperam usque.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Rogati illi, quę res eos du<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>ceret ad caussam hanc agendam pręter omnium expectationem, <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>responderunt a ducibus <placeName ref="l749">Saxonię</placeName>, <persName ref="p19065">Ioannis Friderici</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>elctoris filiis, sibi datum in mandatis.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Res mox relata <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>est ad illustrissimum principem <placeName ref="l572">Wirtebergensem</placeName>, qui unus <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>ex pręsidum est numero.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Is ubi audiit, contestatus est <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>impense sibi dolere, quod de rebus non adeo necessariis <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>eo et loco et tempore, quibus minime decebat, moverentur <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>a quibusdam privatim eę quęstiones, ob quas impediri <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>alia graviora et publica et pernecessaria negotia <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>possent.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Intelligens porro obtrudisse illos principum <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>se iussu facere rem per nuncios protinus communicavit <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>cum principe <placeName ref="l2477">Palatino</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Quamobrem subito quoque hi duo <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>principes ad duces <placeName ref="l749">Saxonię</placeName> aliquos miserunt, qui <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>partim cognoscerent, num illi iussissent, partim, <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>si iussissent, mitigare eos efficereque, quo sopiri talem <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>paterentur contentionem, studerent.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Quę ex eo <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>tempore acciderint, non habeo explicatum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Illud <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>certum est ad decimum diem septembris nullos <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>ex his, qui sive a nostris sive ab adversariis designati <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>sunt, cępisse de rebus ecclesiarum colloqui; nam <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ad eum diem d. <persName ref="p4664">Paulum Eberum</persName> <placeName ref="l558">Vitebergensem</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>amici quidam mei <placeName ref="l157">Francofurti</placeName> viderunt ac salutarunt, <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>nec desunt, qui affirment dominum <persName ref="p458">Brentium</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>tum fuisse <placeName ref="l471">Spirę</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Credebatur tamen initium <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>colloquendi facturos ad 14. diem septembris.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z8"/>Interea novus homo <persName>Croperus</persName> pontificis pridem <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>factus fraterculus quosdam ex his, qui ipsi pro tuenda <lb xml:id="p2z10"/><placeName ref="l425">Romanensi</placeName> causa sunt adiuncti, dicitur odiose insimulare <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>nonullos (sic?) vero et hereseos non modo tacite habere <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>suspectos, verum etiam palam reos peragere velle.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z13"/>Plura ubi audiero aut certiora, laborabo ut rescisca<lb xml:id="p2z14"/>s<lb xml:id="p2z15"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="date">[Datum fehlt.]</note>
				</p>
